Package: aicore
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: AICore Team <dev@aicore.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.31)
Recommends: systemd
Description: AICore — AI Computer Control Layer
 AICore is a user-space AI control layer that sits between applications,
 the operating system, and hardware. It observes system state, infers
 workload, and adapts resources with rollback safety.
 .
 This package installs the AICore daemon, CLI, and dashboard.
